   Some files in the repository are rendered from Minecraft's own textures - the
   recipe pictures under docs/images/recipes/ are drawn from the vanilla client
   assets by tools/recipe_render. Those textures remain the property of Mojang
   Synergies AB, are used here under Mojang's asset and brand guidelines, and no
   rights over them are claimed by this license. Where these terms and Mojang's
   guidelines disagree, Mojang's guidelines apply.

9. NO WARRANTY
   RA is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. The author is not liable
   for any damage, data loss, or other problem arising from its use.

10. ENFORCEMENT AND CHANGES
   Violation of these terms may result in a DMCA takedown request or other
